    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0064-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "may be better options than quetiapine.20 Olanzapine, because of the wealth of evidence suggesting slight \nsuperiority over other antipsychotics, should probably be tried before clozapine unless contra-indicated.21–24 \nNote, however, that one RCT6 found continuing with amisulpride was as effective as switching to \nolanzapine.\n",
