    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0064-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "level monitoring of oral treatment. Most non-adherence is undetected in practice,23,25 and apparent \ntreatment resistance may simply be a result of inadequate treatment.26\n",
      "bbox": [
        63.94409942626953,
        527.7263793945312,
