      "text_sha256": "0596382ba91fb5c312a23eac5e2663f4e981a11293c4c2a1928238205a7470be"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0064-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "■\n■Where there is confirmed treatment resistance (failure to respond to adequate trials of at least two \n",
